{"id":"57498c3ca362c7c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-resikhin-turaev.md","title":"Reshetikhin–Turaev Invariant","display":"df-resikhin-turaev — Reshetikhin–Turaev Invariant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-resikhin-turaev","aliases":["58-df-resikhin-turaev"],"display":"df-resikhin-turaev — Reshetikhin–Turaev Invariant","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-resikhin-turaev"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-resikhin-turaev</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resikhin-turaev — Reshetikhin–Turaev Invariant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L&#39;,\\mathcal C,\\vec V,\\vec V&#39;,RT_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\">\\(L,L&#39;,\\mathcal C,\\vec V,\\vec V&#39;,RT_{\\mathcal C}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (ribbon modular category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)\\)</span> (component colorings by objects of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbb 1)\\cong k\">\\(F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbb 1)\\cong k\\)</span> (colored ribbon-functor value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\">\\((L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\\)</span> (colored framed-link isotopy)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (RT link-invariant predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resikhin\\text{-}turaev} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S(RT_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\forall\\vec V\\in\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)\\;\\bigl(RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\bigr)\\land\\forall L,L&#39;,\\vec V,\\vec V&#39;\\in V\\;\\bigl((L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\\to RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=RT_{\\mathcal C}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resikhin\\text{-}turaev} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S(RT_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\forall\\vec V\\in\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)\\;\\bigl(RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\bigr)\\land\\forall L,L&#39;,\\vec V,\\vec V&#39;\\in V\\;\\bigl((L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\\to RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=RT_{\\mathcal C}(L&#39;,\\vec V&#39;)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Modular tensor categories from quantum groups.</li>\n<li>A surgery sum over colorings with quantum-dimension weights belongs to the associated closed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\">\\(3\\)</span>-manifold invariant, not to the defining colored-link evaluation above.</li>\n<li>Kirby calculus: framed link <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> 3-manifold.</li>\n<li>Skein modules generalize skein relations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"L,L',\\mathcal C,\\vec V,\\vec V',RT_{\\mathcal C}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathbb 1)\\cong k","display":false},{"tex":"(L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L',\\vec V')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}resikhin\\text{-}turaev} \\vdash \\mathrm{ReshetikhinTuraevInvariant}_S(RT_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RibbonModularCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall L\\in V\\;\\forall\\vec V\\in\\operatorname{Col}_{\\mathcal C}(L)\\;\\bigl(RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=F_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)\\bigr)\\land\\forall L,L',\\vec V,\\vec V'\\in V\\;\\bigl((L,\\vec V)\\simeq_{\\mathrm{rib}}(L',\\vec V')\\to RT_{\\mathcal C}(L,\\vec V)=RT_{\\mathcal C}(L',\\vec V')\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"3","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false}],"bytes":1617,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1083","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-resikhin-turaev.md|58-df-resikhin-turaev]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":[]}